        <div class="section-title-box">
            <div class="section-tagline">WHY GBF?</div>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <div class="event-details-content-box">
                    <p>The “Golden Business Forum” (GBF) was established in 2019 as an annual high-level business platform and channel for business development in Africa and beyond. The aim of GBF is to serve as a catalyst for business development in Africa, between Africa and the world.</p>

                    <p>All activities associated with GBF are focused on bringing sustainable and innovative solutions to ongoing structural and long-term economic challenges that impede the growth of the African continent. GBF was honoured to be launched by His Excellency, the President of the Republic of Rwanda, who graciously accepted to be its patron moving forward.</p>

                    <h4>Objectives of the GBF</h4><hr>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled list-style-two">
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To provide a platform for businesses to showcase their products and services to a wide audience.</h5>
                        </li>
                        
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To create networking opportunities for business leaders and entrepreneurs.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To promote trade and investment opportunities between participating countries.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To provide a forum for the exchange of ideas and best practices in various industries.
                            </h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To encourage innovation and collaboration among businesses and organizations.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To foster economic growth and development in Africa.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To support the development of small and medium-sized enterprises.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To promote sustainability and responsible business practices.</h5>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>To foster cultural exchange and understanding among participating countries.</h5>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
